            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Parrot stops parroting your speakers</h3><ul><li>On speakers, their voice stays out of your mic far more often, so fewer echo lines.</li><li>Gauges wait until the call gives them something to go on, so no more fake mood swings.</li><li>Hide Parrot from the Dock while its window is closed, in Settings &gt; General.</li><li>Share a call's report with your team as a clean PDF, from the Share menu.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.5">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
